 "Why is it cancelled?": "Bakit ito kinansela?",
 "Cancelling removes it from the calendar and releases any budget that is not spent.": "Kapag kinansela, aalisin ito sa kalendaryo at ilalabas ang badyet na hindi nagastos.",
 "This activity is no longer available.": "Wala na ang aktibidad na ito.",
